From: davmels <davmelous@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:22:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 16/17] debug: vLLM NaN probe

NRL_DEBUG_NAN_PROBE=1 patches vLLM's GPU model runner in each worker and
prints [nan-probe] lines around in-flight weight updates: persistent-batch
changes, dummy steps during the pause, block-table rows that point at live
requests' state blocks, and non-finite linear-attention state. It syncs the
GPU every decode step; never enable it in production.
